    - Term: D_DRAGON_DESCRIPTION.OBOLFO
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - They hate bat dragons, their mortal enemies, which they chase during the nights of the full moon
      - Odian a los dragones murciélago, sus enemigos mortales, a los que persiguen durante las noches de luna llena
