      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Get {[PRIMARY_VALUE]} crowns and 2 stellar donuts every 200 towers
      - Obtén {[PRIMARY_VALUE]} coronas y 2 donuts estelares cada 200 torres
      - Erhalte {[PRIMARY_VALUE]} Kronen und 2 Sternendonuts alle 200 Türme
      - Obtenez {[PRIMARY_VALUE]} couronnes et 2 beignets stellaires tous les 200 tours
      - Ottieni {[PRIMARY_VALUE]} corone e 2 ciambelle stellari ogni 200 torri
