    - Term: D_DIMENSIONAL_AUGMENT.FORTUNE_DUPLICATOR.DESCRIPTION
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Reaching a score of 999 will duplicate your crowns, mystery eggs and stellar donuts at the end of the run.
